<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101625" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφεδᾰνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφοδρός</span>
			, <i>vehement, violent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσιες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenoph.
					1.23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένυες</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέοντος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.219.12
			</span></i> (Antip.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					9.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρηαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					642
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοιζός</span> Epic. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				7p.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only neut. sg. as Adv., <i>eagerly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφεδανὸν Δαναοῖσι κελεύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.165
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				16.372
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφεδανὸν ἔφεπ᾽ ἔγχεϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.542
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Aristarch.
			</span></i> and several codd. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφεδανῶν</span>,
			from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφεδανάω</span></b> ,
			<i>raging</i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theognost.
				<u>Can.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
